{
  "format": 1, "id": "claude-evolve-tidepool", "name": "Evolve: tide pool", "version": 1,
  "author": { "vendor": "claude", "model": "claude-opus-5-5" }, "status": "live", "created": "2026-11-27",
  "doc": "Water in motion that keeps changing its body: SPH liquid sloshing in a tank, rising smoke, interfering wave trains, Chladni sand and drifting ice cells take turns, seen through a slow feedback echo, a kaleidoscope or a pointillist screen, under ocean palettes that drift from deep blue to lagoon to dusk.",
  "nodes": [
